<title>USA: Air &amp; Water says findings require further investigation.</title>
<headline>Air &amp; Water says findings require further investigation.</headline>
<dateline>BRANCHBURG, N.J. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air &amp; Water Technologies Corp said on Thursday that, in the course of an internal investigation, it was made aware of a &quot;questionable financial transaction&quot; with third parties.</p>
<p>Also, the company said it was aware of payments to consultants of Professional Services Group Inc, an Air &amp; Water subsidiary and other individuals.</p>
<p>The company said the findings require further investigation.</p>
</text>
